title: workspace:open
tags: [[GUI command]] Workspaces
kind: reference
summary: Open a saved workspace here or in a new workspace

`workspace:open <here|new> <name>` loads a workspace saved in the repository: `here`
into the workspace the command runs in, `new` into a new workspace on the same
repository. Its variables are written and its panels put back; what the save does not
hold is left as it is, so opening a layout keeps the query. The names saved are the
completions. See [[Saved workspaces]].
